      "source_text": "9.14 Elephant Rampage: When an Elephant unit routs, it Ram-\npages. Leader Elephants also Rampage, but they have less of a\nchance of doing so. Each time an Elephant unit routs, its player\nrolls the die and does one of the following, depending on the DR:\nDie Roll Result\n0 The Elephant unit heads in the direction of the\nnearest friendly unit, opposing player’s choice\nif there is more than one nearest unit. A Leader\nElephant is eliminated.",
      "transform": "crop only original render pixels"
    },
    {
      "file": {
        "path": "private/poc/spqr-chapter9/evaluation/owner-review-002/evidence/RQ-15c1-Immediate.png",
        "sha256": "690c600a4d0c5c17a1ece7c314ed071f7ca73287f86aac5c3d5b443225f3886c",
        "bytes": 23835
      },
